<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx1.SS3" title="In Appendix ‣ Epistemic Filtering and Collective Hallucination: A Jury Theorem for Confidence-Calibrated Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.3 </span>Proof for the Hallucination Bound.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx1.SS4" title="In Appendix ‣ Epistemic Filtering and Collective Hallucination: A Jury Theorem for Confidence-Calibrated Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Proof for Theorem 3.</span></a></li>
